1
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:45,160
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

4
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:48,080
LONGEVITY

5
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,200
‪-That's amazing.
‪-Right.

6
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,320
Come.

7
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,600
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

8
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,520
Come.

9
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:02,920
- Try this.
- It's delicious.

10
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,160
Wonderful.

11
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:24,600
Lady Xie, what do you think
is the thickest thing in the world?

12
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,880
I'd say some people's skin.

13
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,840
No blade can cut it,
no arrow can pierce it.

14
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:33,760
How else could they commit
so many vile deeds

15
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,880
and still smile as if nothing happened,

16
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:37,280
without a shred of shame?

17
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:40,560
Lady Xie said she was too ill to come.

18
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:43,920
But you asked her several times,
and insisted her to attend.

19
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,840
<i>So that's Xie Hualou.</i>

20
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:49,520
She looks much thinner than before.

21
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,480
Are you feeling better now?

22
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:54,760
Don't you know what made Lady Xie ill?

23
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:57,480
She had the misfortune of crossing
a vicious, treacherous woman

24
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:59,920
who nearly cost her life.

25
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,080
From what she's saying,
could it be her cousin-in-law?

26
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:04,680
Don't go accusing people blindly.

27
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:07,480
Attempted murder is punishable by hanging.

28
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:11,000
Hualou, you mustn't let a moment of mercy

29
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:13,000
allow evil to fester and bring more harm.

30
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:18,880
It is still the seventh month,
and the heat hasn't let up.

31
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:21,440
I'm afraid the young ladies can't bear it.

32
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,320
They've seen
this entertainment many times.

33
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,760
Why not let them take a walk

34
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:30,360
and enjoy the grounds
of the Duke's Residence?

35
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:34,880
Heat? I'd say someone's hiding
a guilty conscience.

36
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:37,680
Her plot failed, and now she's ashamed.

37
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:42,480
Old Madam Xie, why would you say that?

38
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,920
Our Xie family

39
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,080
has done everything to protect
the Duke's reputation.

40
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:49,440
We have no wish to shatter the jade vase
in pursuit of a rat.

41
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:52,280
Otherwise,
I'd have gone straight to the Wei family

42
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,400
and demanded justice.

43
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:56,480
So why keep pretending you know nothing?

44
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:02,080
Brother. What exactly is going on?

45
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,800
From what I can see,
something seems a little off.

46
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:21,839
Bring it in.

47
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:29,400
- What's going on?
- What is it?

48
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,400
Here comes a cool breeze.

49
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,720
I've never seen anything like this before.

50
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,080
Interesting.

51
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,440
LONGEVITY

52
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,800
It really does fill
the hall with a breeze.

53
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,160
It's so cool, my arms are getting chilly.

54
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,600
Brother, you're brilliant.

55
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,920
With this wind wheel,

56
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:51,040
the room is filled
with refreshing lotus fragrance.

57
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,240
What a clever contraption.

58
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,760
Brother, you've kept this well hidden.
Only showing it to us now?

59
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,240
This summer has been unbearably hot.

60
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,600
And the ladies
are all dressed formally for the banquet.

61
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:02,240
Rao feared the ladies
may fall victim to heatstroke

62
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,560
so she had the finest craftsmen make it.

63
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:07,480
The palace craftsmen
have made seven-bladed fans before.

64
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,640
- But…
- It really is impressive.

65
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,560
She is very thoughtful,

66
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:13,120
always attentive to the smallest details.

67
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:18,040
How unusual. Brother is always so stern.

68
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:21,000
When have we ever heard him praise anyone?

69
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:24,080
It seems he's quite pleased
with his new wife.

70
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:31,280
This spinning-wheel-style wind wheel
was inspired by a farm winnowing fan.

71
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:34,240
Farmers use its airflow
to blow away the chaff,

72
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,480
making it much easier to winnow grain.

73
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:38,640
Qingtong told me

74
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:40,040
Grandmother has been unwell in the heat,

75
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:42,560
listless and weary with no appetite.

76
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:46,320
So I asked My Lord
to have someone make this.

77
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,840
Thankfully, it was ready
for the birthday banquet,

78
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:52,200
so our guests won't have
to suffer in the heat.

79
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:56,240
I've seen a fan like this
at a farm's threshing ground.

80
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:59,520
I never knew it could be used this way.

81
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:04,000
I wonder how all seven blades
are linked together.

82
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:07,320
What a good girl.

83
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:11,200
Lu Zhuo, you've married
such a devoted and virtuous wife.

84
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:14,920
You must have earned
this blessing in a past life.

85
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:18,640
My dear, I must thank you as well.

86
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:21,200
When the Lu family was in dire straits,

87
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:23,040
you entrusted this blessed girl
to our family.

88
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:26,320
She is not only Lu Zhuo's lifesaver,

89
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:29,200
also a blessing to our entire family.

90
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,800
You're too kind, Old Madam Lu.

91
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:34,400
She's still young. Such praise

92
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:37,600
might bring her more fortune
than she can bear.

93
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:41,560
How many people
ever get a second chance at life?

94
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:44,560
Lord Lu owes it all
to marrying such a blessed wife.

95
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,640
Indeed.

96
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:52,640
My Lady, the Xie family
may attend the banquet too.

97
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:54,480
I'm worried…

98
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,400
THE XIE AND HAN FAMILIES ARE SWORN ENEMIES

99
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,360
There's no avoiding them.

100
00:06:58,200 --> 00:07:01,600
I'll bear the consequences
of Wei Rao's mistakes.

101
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,840
But as long as Lord Lu

102
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,880
cares about the Duke's reputation

103
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,280
and wishes his grandmother to enjoy
the birthday banquet,

104
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:12,000
he

105
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,920
will be my strongest shield.

106
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,520
Move them to both sides.

107
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,160
Come.

108
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,480
<i>On the Duchess's birthday banquet,</i>

109
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:49,080
<i>even the slightest slip</i>
<i>will be the talk of the town.</i>

110
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,440
Rest assured, Madam.

111
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:53,560
That whole box of butterflies
has been smothered to death.

112
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:56,520
She'll disgrace herself
before everyone at the banquet.

113
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:02,800
Mother,

114
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:06,840
I heard your granddaughter-in-law
won't follow tradition this year.

115
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:09,840
She plans to release butterflies
for your birthday.

116
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:12,680
Look, she even brought in a lotus vat.

117
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:15,720
Soon, at this banquet,

118
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:18,880
lights blazing, lotuses blooming,

119
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,360
butterflies fluttering everywhere.

120
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:24,120
Truly an ingenious and delightful idea.

121
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:27,400
Butterflies? Open it! Hurry!

122
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,840
The air holes in that bamboo box
look far too small.

123
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:32,200
On such an auspicious day,

124
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:34,559
we mustn't let
any living creature suffocate.

125
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:37,120
Quick. Let them out at once.

126
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,480
Hurry, let them out.

127
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:42,400
Grandmother, if I may,
please open it yourself.

128
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,640
The butterflies really suffocated?

129
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:17,960
A joyous day
has turned into needless killing.

130
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:20,600
It'll cost blessings and longevity.
How awful!

131
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:21,760
Exactly.

132
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:23,800
They all suffocated in the box.

133
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:25,960
That's a terrible omen.

134
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:28,080
She should've just followed tradition.

135
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:30,080
But no, she had to do something different.

136
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:33,000
And look at the bad luck it's brought.

137
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,080
The Duchess despises
the killing of living creatures.

138
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:37,280
She'll be furious.

139
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:49,440
This is… a fire lighter?

140
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,280
Bring it in.

141
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:44,520
Those… Those aren't butterflies!

142
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,960
Then why were you catching butterflies?

143
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:50,720
Third Aunt,
living creatures are meant to be free.

144
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:51,720
Why catch them just to release them?

145
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,280
Besides, butterflies may be beautiful,

146
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,800
but the powder on their wings
can be harmful.

147
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:57,640
Butterflies left the dew-gathering maids
with red and swollen eyes.

148
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,120
I merely had them driven away.

149
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,440
She refused to have it brought in openly.

150
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:05,560
she meant for everyone
to guess what's in the box.

151
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,840
Cheeky move, I'll say that.

152
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,400
Grandmother.

153
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,840
This lamp is called Everfull.

154
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:19,680
Everfull means
may your years be ever full.

155
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:24,440
May you live
a long, healthy, peaceful life.

156
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:28,040
You're awfully young
to make such a grand promise.

157
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:30,400
How can a mere lamp promise peace?

158
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:33,360
There were meant to be 108 lamps,

159
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:35,800
corresponding to 108 worries.

160
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:38,000
Once they're burned away,
Grandmother will be worry-free.

161
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:43,480
And this one has…

162
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,040
60 lamps?

163
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:48,160
Yes. Grandmother shall light it yourself.

164
00:11:48,680 --> 00:11:51,760
For each year you gain,
let one more lamp be added.

165
00:11:52,280 --> 00:11:54,920
One year after another,
until there are 108 lamps.

166
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,160
That would be true and endless blessings.

167
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:01,560
You sweet-talking child.

168
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:05,320
Do you expect me to live past 100?

169
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,680
I'd be an old fossil by then!

170
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:10,520
- She's joking.
- So it's a centennial lamp.

171
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:12,680
What an auspicious sign.

172
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:14,120
Far more than 100 years.

173
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:17,320
Since ancient times,
108 has meant perfect fulfillment.

174
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:19,840
It's called 108,
but it wishes for a boundless longevity.

175
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:21,640
What a thoughtful idea.

176
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:25,600
Every wick on this lamp was made
by Wei Rao from lamp paper

177
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,240
and twisted by hand.

178
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,960
It shows her heartfelt devotion.

179
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:35,840
Mother was kind enough to spare me
from most of the household affairs,

180
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:39,160
so I had time to personally
prepare this gift for Grandmother.

181
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,640
Good.

182
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,560
It's the least I can do.

183
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,560
Grandmother, please light the lamp.

184
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:02,120
All right.

185
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:45,440
- It's beautiful.
- It is.

186
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:56,520
My Lord. General Qi
and the Han family are fighting.

187
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:06,360
Look.

188
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:09,560
Han Liao, today is a joyous day
for the Duke's family.

189
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:10,840
Making trouble again?

190
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:11,960
Get out of my way!

191
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:13,720
You have a death wish?

192
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:15,080
Stop.

193
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:20,480
Lord Lu, forgive the disturbance.

194
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:24,040
Zhuo, I had barely arrived
when he came looking for trouble.

195
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:26,640
I came to deliver a birthday gift
on behalf of my mother,

196
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:29,200
and got attacked the moment I arrived.

197
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:32,080
Everyone here saw it.

198
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:35,280
General Qi attacked me without asking.

199
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:37,720
Lord Lu,

200
00:14:38,880 --> 00:14:40,720
is this how the Lu family
treats its guests?

201
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:43,400
So what if I attack?

202
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:45,800
Back when we marched on Hutuo,
you were supposed to back us up.

203
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:48,280
When things got bad, you delayed
and refused to dispatch troops

204
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,200
almost cost us the war.

205
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:52,000
- You deserved every blow!
- Enough!

206
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:57,160
A guest is a guest once they're
through the door. For my sake,

207
00:14:57,800 --> 00:15:00,480
No fighting tonight. Don't make a scene.

208
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:04,560
Out of respect for Lord Lu,
I'll let this brute off.

209
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:11,360
The Duke sent word.

210
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:13,520
He wants you
in the front courtyard to receive guests.

211
00:15:14,160 --> 00:15:15,760
The Marquis of Pingxi
heard General Qi had arrived

212
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,880
and wants you there
to help with the drinking.

213
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:19,920
Lady Rao came dressed for the occasion…

214
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,160
- I…
- I'll go now.

215
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:25,320
Lord Han.

216
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:33,880
My mother acquired a precious mirror
from the Western Regions.

217
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:37,040
She insisted I present it
to the Duchess myself.

218
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:42,920
I'll first pay my respects
to the birthday lady,

219
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,160
present the gift, and toast.

220
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:46,240
Then I'll join you at the banquet.

221
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,760
Please apologize to the Duke for me.

222
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:50,160
Tell him I'll be there shortly.

223
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:52,920
Rest assured, Lord Lu.

224
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,360
I was also born into a noble family.

225
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,480
My conduct reflects my family's honor.

226
00:15:57,560 --> 00:16:00,880
Causing trouble at a birthday banquet
would only make me a laughingstock.

227
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:05,160
At least I know how to behave,
unlike some people.

228
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:09,520
I'll show our guest the way.

229
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:11,720
Lord Han, please.

230
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:24,000
- Thank you. This way.
- All right.

231
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:26,120
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

232
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,040
Lord Huo.

233
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:31,840
Please inform Her Ladyship

234
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:35,320
that Huo Jue, on Lady Shou'an's orders,
has brought a Nuo opera troupe

235
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:37,440
to celebrate the Duchess's birthday.

236
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:39,880
Lord Huo,
please have some tea in the hall.

237
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,040
I'll report your arrival at once.

238
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:44,960
- Let's go.
- This way.

239
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,560
Your Ladyship, a moment.

240
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:58,480
I hear Lord Lu's old wound
still hasn't healed.

241
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:01,600
My family has a healer

242
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:03,200
who's highly skilled at treating wounds.

243
00:17:03,280 --> 00:17:06,240
Her family's Dragon Bone Wound Powder
is unmatched.

244
00:17:07,599 --> 00:17:08,440
Madam Liu.

245
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:09,560
Yes!

246
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:24,319
Madam Liu,
pay your respects to Her Ladyship.

247
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:28,400
Greetings, Lady… Lady Lu.

248
00:17:36,760 --> 00:17:39,800
What is it? Do you know this woman?

249
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:53,680
Lord Lu was wounded
fighting for the realm.

250
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:56,760
His Majesty has asked
about his recovery many times.

251
00:17:56,840 --> 00:17:59,360
Therefore, Lord Lu's health

252
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,560
has always been overseen
by imperial physicians.

253
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:06,200
Only senior physicians skilled
in medicine, acupuncture, and surgery

254
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:09,240
with 20 years of practice
are permitted to come here.

255
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:10,960
Lord Han, may I ask

256
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:13,760
where did you find this quack?

257
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:16,240
And you dare bring her here so brazenly?

258
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:17,520
What?

259
00:18:18,600 --> 00:18:21,480
Do you think so little
of His Majesty's imperial physicians?

260
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:23,960
Or do you look down on the Lu family?

261
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:29,640
Or are you plotting to harm Lord Lu?

262
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:35,880
You insolent old woman!
How dare you stare at the noble lady?

263
00:18:36,800 --> 00:18:39,240
Forgive me! I wouldn't dare.

264
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:41,720
Didn't you say Her Ladyship
looked like someone you once knew?

265
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,600
Look up and take a good look.

266
00:18:55,280 --> 00:18:58,200
Her figure does look somewhat similar.

267
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:06,360
But the young woman I knew

268
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,440
was just a night-soil woman.

269
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:12,120
She was filthy,
with matted hair and a dirty face,

270
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:14,040
and wouldn't wash her face for months.

271
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:18,520
No one even knew
what she really looked like.

272
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:22,760
Compared to this elegant young lady,

273
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:26,360
she was a firefly beside the moon,

274
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,160
a crow beside a phoenix.

275
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,680
How could they possibly compare?

276
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:32,680
That's not what you told me before!

277
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:35,480
A what?

278
00:19:38,280 --> 00:19:39,720
Lord Han, what did you compare me to?

279
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:44,040
My Lady, she said a night-soil woman.

280
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:47,120
You… How dare you!

281
00:19:48,480 --> 00:19:50,200
How dare you compare me
to a night-soil woman!

282
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:51,880
There must be some misunderstanding.

283
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,320
Guards, see them out!

284
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:58,360
You filthy vermin!

285
00:19:58,440 --> 00:20:00,720
Your vile nonsense has deeply insulted me.

286
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:03,120
If my maternal grandmother were here,

287
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,040
she'd have torn your mouth apart by now!

288
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:08,480
Bitao, throw this old beggar out!

289
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:09,680
Yes.

290
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:12,520
Someone, have Lu Zhuo come here!

291
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:13,840
- Lord Han!
- He brought this vile guest here.

292
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:14,760
- Lord Han!
- He can deal with her himself.

293
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:17,880
- I only did what you told me!
- You wretched thing.

294
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:19,600
- Lord Han!
- Lady Wei Rao!

295
00:20:20,120 --> 00:20:21,000
Lord Han!

296
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:25,800
Even her wit and temper have style.

297
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:28,520
What a shame she's married
to that prude Lu Zhuo.

298
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:30,880
Such a pity.

299
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:34,080
Lord Han, I'll show you the way.

300
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:38,320
There are many ladies in the garden.
We mustn't disturb them.

301
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:41,120
Wait here.

302
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,680
There's no need to follow.

303
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:47,720
What are you doing? I…

304
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:52,720
This is outrageous!

305
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:54,200
The mighty Duke's Residence

306
00:20:54,280 --> 00:20:58,200
is bullying a helpless old widow like me!

307
00:20:59,280 --> 00:21:01,880
You're hurting me!

308
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:04,160
My lady has a kind heart.

309
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:06,880
She knows you're a fraud
with bad intentions,

310
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:10,040
but she won't tarnish
the Lu family's reputation for charity.

311
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:10,960
Here.

312
00:21:11,040 --> 00:21:13,880
A bag of millet so you won't go hungry.
And no more swindling people.

313
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:16,120
Behave yourself.

314
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:31,480
My Lady.

315
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:33,560
Is everything delivered?

316
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:35,320
Yes.

317
00:21:36,120 --> 00:21:37,880
Madam doesn't want
to see that unwelcome guest.

318
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:39,080
Go tell Dowager Lady

319
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:42,880
- that my Lady went back to change.
- Yes.

320
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:49,360
Thank goodness she saw it.

321
00:21:52,160 --> 00:21:53,440
Thank goodness she understood.

322
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:56,320
<i>Seeing the begonia hairpin</i>
<i>means seeing me.</i>

323
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,920
<i>Madam Liu, please help me.</i>

324
00:21:58,960 --> 00:22:01,520
<i>I'll repay you generously</i>
<i>for today's favor.</i>

325
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:09,040
It's mine! Don't take it!

326
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:14,960
Give it to me! Let go!

327
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:29,480
Good girl.

328
00:22:29,560 --> 00:22:32,440
Looks like I didn't teach you in vain.

329
00:22:32,960 --> 00:22:36,680
"If you make it big, don't forget me"
was your very first lesson.

330
00:22:37,360 --> 00:22:39,280
<i>When Madam Liu was 14,</i>

331
00:22:39,360 --> 00:22:41,720
<i>a wicked neighbor sold her to a brothel.</i>

332
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:43,520
<i>Her working name was Begonia.</i>

333
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:47,320
Proud of her beauty,
she thought highly of herself.

334
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:50,200
Even there,
she always had to outdo the others.

335
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:53,320
She took every client
she could to please the madam,

336
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:57,880
all for fine clothes,
good food, and a life of pleasure.

337
00:22:58,480 --> 00:23:00,880
Until her beauty faded
and she fell gravely ill.

338
00:23:02,360 --> 00:23:04,280
The madam turned on her
and tried to bury her alive.

339
00:23:04,360 --> 00:23:05,640
Only then did she finally wake up.

340
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:09,040
She taught me my first song.

341
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:11,960
She taught me to hide
my face beneath grime

342
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:14,760
and patiently wait
for my chance to escape.

343
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:19,840
You see, the people who taught me

344
00:23:21,320 --> 00:23:23,040
were either lowly courtesans,

345
00:23:24,120 --> 00:23:25,840
down-and-out scholars,

346
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,200
some family's despised concubine,

347
00:23:29,760 --> 00:23:32,200
or wastrels
who'd squandered their fortunes.

348
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:35,920
They never fought each other
over petty gains.

349
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:38,160
And yet, they were also the ones

350
00:23:40,040 --> 00:23:42,600
who taught me so many valuable things.

351
00:23:43,560 --> 00:23:45,000
Like what?

352
00:23:45,600 --> 00:23:49,440
Lessons they only learned
after being beaten down by this world.

353
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,520
You need nerve

354
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:54,400
before you can claim you're right.

355
00:23:58,560 --> 00:23:59,520
My Lady.

356
00:24:00,040 --> 00:24:01,240
I'm fine.

357
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:04,200
I could barely eat at the banquet,

358
00:24:04,840 --> 00:24:06,360
and then I had to face Han Liao.

359
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:08,640
My chest hurts a little.

360
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:13,440
It's stomach pain.
You've been so busy lately,

361
00:24:13,520 --> 00:24:16,080
always on edge and worrying too much.

362
00:24:17,040 --> 00:24:18,400
Let me help you back to rest.

363
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:21,600
Your Ladyship.

364
00:24:23,560 --> 00:24:24,480
Your Ladyship.

365
00:24:25,000 --> 00:24:26,760
Lady Shou'an sent
the Huo family's eldest son

366
00:24:26,840 --> 00:24:28,200
to wish Old Madam a happy birthday.

367
00:24:28,720 --> 00:24:32,480
He even brought a Nuo opera troupe.
He's waiting in Jiangyun Hall.

368
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:37,320
Understood. You may go.

369
00:24:38,120 --> 00:24:39,000
Yes.

370
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:50,880
I got past Xie Hualou.

371
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:55,000
I got past Han Liao too.

372
00:24:57,880 --> 00:24:59,400
As for Huo Jue…

373
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:03,680
I'll get past him too.

374
00:25:04,280 --> 00:25:06,680
Lord Huo is Lady Rao's cousin.

375
00:25:07,320 --> 00:25:09,440
He knows her temperament
and habits very well.

376
00:25:10,040 --> 00:25:13,120
I can find a way to send him away.
Shall we?

377
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:22,160
He's here for me.

378
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:27,080
JIANGYUN HALL

379
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:35,680
We won't need any of you here.
You may all leave.

380
00:25:35,760 --> 00:25:37,400
JIANGYUN HALL

381
00:25:59,080 --> 00:26:02,600
GALAXY OF VERSES

382
00:26:05,160 --> 00:26:06,000
Rao.

383
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:08,000
Brother Jue.

384
00:26:08,720 --> 00:26:09,800
It's been a long time.

385
00:26:16,840 --> 00:26:18,680
You do look somewhat like her.

386
00:26:19,360 --> 00:26:21,040
But your nature and manner differ greatly.

387
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:23,400
The moment you spoke,

388
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:25,600
I knew you weren't her.

389
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:28,640
Bitao.

390
00:26:29,640 --> 00:26:32,280
My cousin brought a Nuo opera troupe
for the birthday celebration.

391
00:26:33,920 --> 00:26:36,680
Go check
if everything is properly arranged.

392
00:26:38,120 --> 00:26:38,960
Yes.

393
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:50,280
Know how I saw through you
at first glance?

394
00:26:51,040 --> 00:26:52,840
My little cousin

395
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:54,880
was the proudest lady in the world.

396
00:26:55,480 --> 00:26:56,800
Ever since we were children,

397
00:26:57,320 --> 00:26:58,840
unless she needed a favor,

398
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:02,880
whenever she saw me,
she'd call me by name.

399
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:04,760
She'd never sweetly call me "Brother Jue."

400
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:08,000
After all, everyone doted on her.

401
00:27:08,080 --> 00:27:10,080
She had every reason
to look down on the world.

402
00:27:14,760 --> 00:27:16,000
But you?

403
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:19,000
A woman of the lowest birth,

404
00:27:19,760 --> 00:27:23,600
someone even ordinary people
would go out of their way to avoid.

405
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:27,000
You aren't even fit to hold her stirrup,

406
00:27:27,920 --> 00:27:29,520
much less take her place.

407
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:33,680
You're just a cheap imitation,
making a fool of yourself.

408
00:27:34,560 --> 00:27:36,160
The estate is packed
with guests right now.

409
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:37,360
Everyone is watching.

410
00:27:38,560 --> 00:27:39,600
So here's some friendly advice.

411
00:27:39,680 --> 00:27:42,600
Admit the truth before I expose you.

412
00:27:43,600 --> 00:27:45,440
Give back everything that isn't yours.

413
00:27:45,520 --> 00:27:49,160
Maybe I'll let you live.

414
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:55,360
Who decides my life to be worthless?

415
00:27:56,400 --> 00:28:00,200
Who decides the fates to be rich or poor,

416
00:28:00,920 --> 00:28:03,120
the lives to be insignificant or noble?

417
00:28:04,360 --> 00:28:06,080
What gives anyone the right to decide?

418
00:28:09,080 --> 00:28:11,880
Virtue? Yet in this world,

419
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:15,880
some people are rotten to the core
and still live in luxury.

420
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:19,000
Some commit every evil imaginable
and are still made generals and lords!

421
00:28:19,840 --> 00:28:22,920
Heaven is blind. Heaven is unjust!

422
00:28:24,360 --> 00:28:27,600
It cast me into the mud from birth

423
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:30,320
and expects me to rot there forever.

424
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:33,720
No.

425
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:36,640
Even if it's Heaven itself,

426
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:41,120
it has no right.

427
00:28:41,720 --> 00:28:43,120
No one can beat fate!

428
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:46,760
You were born lowly.
How dare you covet what was never yours?

429
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:49,720
If Heaven wants me in the mud,
then I'll defy Heaven itself!

430
00:28:50,880 --> 00:28:52,800
I'll either win or die.

431
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:55,400
I'm not even afraid of Heaven.

432
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:58,840
You think I'm afraid of you?

433
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:01,320
Don't keep fooling yourself.

434
00:29:01,400 --> 00:29:04,800
Leave the Lu family with me now.
Give back everything you've taken.

435
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:06,760
I ensure you a life of wealth and peace.

436
00:29:07,920 --> 00:29:08,760
You're…

437
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:12,040
Lying.

438
00:29:14,600 --> 00:29:16,640
Back when I crawled on the ground,

439
00:29:17,800 --> 00:29:20,400
countless noblemen's boots
trampled my hands.

440
00:29:21,320 --> 00:29:23,040
That's when I learned

441
00:29:23,680 --> 00:29:26,080
That look you get when you're lying.

442
00:29:26,160 --> 00:29:29,920
I saw through your lofty,
hypocritical, scheming faces.

443
00:29:30,600 --> 00:29:33,200
Don't think your sweet talk can fool me.

444
00:29:33,800 --> 00:29:37,600
If you truly meant to spare me,
you wouldn't have walked in here

445
00:29:38,200 --> 00:29:40,040
trying to humiliate and threaten me.

446
00:29:41,320 --> 00:29:44,800
If I believed you and walked out of here.

447
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:48,160
I'd be dead in the street by tomorrow.

448
00:29:50,520 --> 00:29:53,080
Weren't you going to expose me? Go ahead!

449
00:29:53,680 --> 00:29:55,520
Take it all the way
to His Majesty if you want.

450
00:29:55,600 --> 00:29:57,520
All of you shall go down with me.

451
00:30:00,800 --> 00:30:02,200
Anything else to say, Brother Jue?

452
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:04,320
If not,

453
00:30:05,840 --> 00:30:06,920
I'll be back to the banquet.

454
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:09,240
Stop!

455
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:13,040
You're the bravest woman I've ever met.

456
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:17,200
There's nothing
you won't dare think or do.

457
00:30:18,320 --> 00:30:20,480
If you're willing to risk everything,

458
00:30:21,600 --> 00:30:23,280
what can I possibly do to you?

459
00:30:24,120 --> 00:30:25,280
Stay a little longer.

460
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:27,200
Let's talk this through.

461
00:30:53,240 --> 00:30:54,920
You knew I was a schemer and a hypocrite.

462
00:30:55,000 --> 00:30:57,160
You should've been more careful.

463
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:59,120
Too bad.

464
00:31:04,240 --> 00:31:05,600
I gave you my word,

465
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:07,160
and I never break it.

466
00:31:09,080 --> 00:31:11,440
Huo Jue, kill her.

467
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:17,600
This isn't the place.

468
00:31:32,040 --> 00:31:34,080
Then I'll carve

469
00:31:35,880 --> 00:31:38,440
a dozen cuts into her face

470
00:31:39,120 --> 00:31:43,720
and see if she still dares impersonate me.

471
00:31:45,520 --> 00:31:46,880
Han Liao didn't deliberately
cause trouble, did he?

472
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:48,040
Give who trouble?

473
00:31:49,280 --> 00:31:50,400
Her Ladyship isn't at the banquet.

474
00:31:50,480 --> 00:31:51,960
Her maternal family,
the Zhous, sent someone.

475
00:31:52,040 --> 00:31:55,200
But Lady Shou'an rarely has dealings
with the capital's noble families.

476
00:31:55,280 --> 00:31:57,760
Yet she specifically asked her cousin
to meet her in Jiangyun Hall.

477
00:31:59,120 --> 00:31:59,960
Cousin?

478
00:32:09,680 --> 00:32:12,200
My Lord, please wait.
I need to speak with you.

479
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:20,040
JIANGYUN HALL

480
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:25,680
Hurry.

481
00:32:31,840 --> 00:32:33,640
I've always admired you

482
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:36,120
as a man who knows right from wrong
and puts justice above personal ties.

483
00:32:36,200 --> 00:32:39,560
But you know fully well
that Wei Rao pushed me.

484
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:41,120
Why are you covering for her?

485
00:32:41,200 --> 00:32:43,200
Just because she's your wife,

486
00:32:43,280 --> 00:32:45,480
she can ignore right and wrong
and twist the truth?

487
00:32:45,560 --> 00:32:47,360
Do you know that at the banquet,

488
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:49,440
if I hadn't spared the Duke's family

489
00:32:49,520 --> 00:32:51,400
and exposed her in front of everyone,

490
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:54,720
her reputation would've been ruined
across the capital.

491
00:32:58,040 --> 00:32:59,080
What are you laughing at?

492
00:32:59,160 --> 00:33:01,440
That day,
aside from Xie and Wei family servants,

493
00:33:02,040 --> 00:33:03,600
there was no one else in the pavilion.

494
00:33:05,720 --> 00:33:07,200
That's why Old Madam Xie
only dared to make veiled accusations.

495
00:33:08,080 --> 00:33:09,360
That's the real issue.

496
00:33:09,960 --> 00:33:11,680
So you weren't protecting
the bigger picture.

497
00:33:11,760 --> 00:33:12,960
You were simply weighing the risks.

498
00:33:13,800 --> 00:33:16,680
Wei Rao is the Duke's new daughter-in-law.

499
00:33:16,760 --> 00:33:18,560
She is my lawful wife.

500
00:33:19,800 --> 00:33:21,520
Family comes before outsiders.

501
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:23,680
Even if she has made mistakes,

502
00:33:24,280 --> 00:33:26,000
you shouldn't use them
as an excuse to stop me,

503
00:33:26,600 --> 00:33:30,000
unless you meant to provoke Wei Rao
into losing control in public

504
00:33:30,080 --> 00:33:31,200
and making even more mistakes.

505
00:33:32,120 --> 00:33:34,800
So you're saying I'm an outsider,
with no right to question your wife

506
00:33:34,880 --> 00:33:37,080
or interfere in your marriage?

507
00:33:37,760 --> 00:33:41,280
If Wei Rao is wrong,
I'll correct her and counsel her.

508
00:33:42,840 --> 00:33:44,160
You needn't concern yourself
with her anymore.

509
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:50,000
I was wrong about you.

510
00:34:00,040 --> 00:34:00,880
Let's go.

511
00:34:17,520 --> 00:34:18,679
Don't blame me.

512
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:21,199
Once we make it safely through tonight,
I'll hand her over to you.

513
00:34:21,800 --> 00:34:22,840
You can do whatever you want with her.

514
00:34:24,080 --> 00:34:27,239
I'll go to the banquet first.
Rao, follow the plan.

515
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:28,679
Understood.

516
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:30,239
I'll go ahead.

517
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:33,600
JIANGYUN HALL

518
00:34:50,280 --> 00:34:51,560
Dowager Lady has asked twice already.

519
00:34:51,639 --> 00:34:54,960
Go to Jiangyun Hall and tell Her Ladyship
must return to the banquet at once.

520
00:34:55,040 --> 00:34:56,080
Yes.

521
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:02,080
Come on, come on!

522
00:35:02,160 --> 00:35:03,280
Place your bets!

523
00:35:03,360 --> 00:35:04,280
- Come on!
- Place your bets!

524
00:35:04,360 --> 00:35:05,240
- I'm betting odd!
- Bet on what?

525
00:35:05,320 --> 00:35:07,040
- I'm betting even!
- Odd or even?

526
00:35:07,120 --> 00:35:11,560
- Even!
- Odd!

527
00:35:14,280 --> 00:35:15,480
- Again!
- I'm betting even!

528
00:35:15,560 --> 00:35:17,320
- Odd!
- I'm all in!

529
00:35:19,840 --> 00:35:21,200
My maternal grandmother
went home for the ancestral rites

530
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:23,040
and couldn't make it to the banquet.

531
00:35:23,120 --> 00:35:26,040
She asked me to bring
a highly skilled Nuo opera troupe

532
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:28,160
to offer the Duchess

533
00:35:28,240 --> 00:35:31,160
blessings, good fortune, and long life.

534
00:35:31,760 --> 00:35:32,680
Wonderful.

535
00:35:33,560 --> 00:35:35,560
Lady Xie, look!

536
00:35:35,640 --> 00:35:37,560
They're performing
a Nuo dance for blessings.

537
00:36:01,520 --> 00:36:04,800
<i>She never returned to the banquet.</i>
<i>Where else could she have gone?</i>

538
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:25,720
What a beautiful dance.

539
00:37:26,720 --> 00:37:27,960
‪Her Ladyship!

540
00:37:29,040 --> 00:37:30,240
‪It is Her Ladyship.

541
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:31,160
Rao!

542
00:37:34,120 --> 00:37:35,880
Bravo! Bravo!

543
00:37:35,960 --> 00:37:38,280
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

544
00:37:40,360 --> 00:37:41,880
As your granddaughter-in-law,
I offer this dance

545
00:37:41,960 --> 00:37:43,280
to honor you on your birthday.

546
00:37:43,360 --> 00:37:45,960
May Heaven bless you
with joy, harmony, and good fortune.

547
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:50,080
May you enjoy endless blessings,
long life, and perfect health.

548
00:37:51,280 --> 00:37:52,480
- Wonderful!
- It's Rao!

549
00:37:52,560 --> 00:37:54,000
Rao was the one dancing.

550
00:37:55,520 --> 00:37:57,520
She really put her heart into this.

551
00:37:58,520 --> 00:38:00,080
She even kept it a secret from all of us.

552
00:38:00,160 --> 00:38:01,920
With such striking makeup,

553
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:03,480
she looks like
a completely different person.

554
00:38:04,680 --> 00:38:06,320
No wonder her dance was beautiful,

555
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:08,560
yet her movements looked different
from everyone else's.

556
00:38:08,640 --> 00:38:10,000
So it was Rao!

557
00:38:15,680 --> 00:38:17,400
Then I'll carve

558
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,400
a dozen cuts into her face

559
00:38:20,600 --> 00:38:24,480
and see if she still dares impersonate me.

560
00:38:30,200 --> 00:38:32,680
You can't kill her
and stain Jiangyun Hall with blood.

561
00:38:32,760 --> 00:38:33,920
There will be no hiding from it.

562
00:38:34,920 --> 00:38:36,880
Your tempers and manners
are completely different.

563
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:38,160
Even if you change makeup and clothes,

564
00:38:38,240 --> 00:38:39,320
anyone paying attention
will see through you.

565
00:38:40,280 --> 00:38:43,120
We need a way to distract everyone

566
00:38:43,200 --> 00:38:44,360
so no one has time to notice.

567
00:38:46,360 --> 00:38:48,840
Brother Jue,
you really are a cunning merchant.

568
00:38:49,680 --> 00:38:51,000
You're incredibly devious.

569
00:38:52,640 --> 00:38:56,400
A cunning merchant will do anything
to make sure you get what you want.

570
00:38:57,480 --> 00:39:00,680
After all, years ago,
I gave your mother my word.

571
00:39:01,680 --> 00:39:04,520
At the banquet later,
you must be extremely careful.

572
00:39:04,600 --> 00:39:05,800
Don't make a single mistake.

573
00:39:11,280 --> 00:39:12,920
Rao can do this too?

574
00:39:23,000 --> 00:39:26,160
Forgive me, Old Madam. I slipped.

575
00:39:26,240 --> 00:39:27,600
I'm afraid I've spoiled everyone's fun.

576
00:39:35,080 --> 00:39:36,240
They say

577
00:39:36,320 --> 00:39:38,200
Nuo dance
can connect mortals with the divine.

578
00:39:38,280 --> 00:39:41,800
Yesterday, I was blessed to see
the Queen Mother descend upon Penglai

579
00:39:41,880 --> 00:39:42,720
to hold a lotus feast.

580
00:39:43,320 --> 00:39:45,280
She took a sacred lotus
from Mount Taihua's Jade Well.

581
00:39:46,360 --> 00:39:49,320
Its bloom spanned 100 feet,
its root as large as a boat.

582
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:51,440
It was cold as frost
and sweeter than honey.

583
00:39:51,520 --> 00:39:53,920
They say Peng Zu
ate just one slice of its root

584
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:56,120
and lived for 800 years.

585
00:39:57,160 --> 00:39:59,760
So I quickly plucked one lotus petal

586
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:02,040
and hid it in my robe.

587
00:40:02,120 --> 00:40:03,120
When I suddenly awoke,

588
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:06,600
I was on a boat,
drifting through a lotus pond.

589
00:40:07,200 --> 00:40:10,560
But in my hand,
I was somehow clutching a lotus.

590
00:40:12,200 --> 00:40:14,360
Really? What happened next?

591
00:40:15,640 --> 00:40:16,880
This is that very lotus.

592
00:40:18,160 --> 00:40:21,400
The Queen Mother knew our Grandmother

593
00:40:21,480 --> 00:40:24,400
was kind, generous, and compassionate.

594
00:40:24,480 --> 00:40:26,840
So she bestowed this sacred lotus

595
00:40:27,360 --> 00:40:28,880
upon Grandmother

596
00:40:28,960 --> 00:40:31,800
to bless you with fortune,
health, and a long life.

597
00:40:33,680 --> 00:40:35,560
Wonderful!

598
00:40:35,640 --> 00:40:37,280
- Well said!
- Wonderful!

599
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:39,800
- Indeed.
- Wonderful!

600
00:40:41,120 --> 00:40:43,720
Rao, you really went all out

601
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:46,480
to celebrate my birthday.

602
00:40:46,560 --> 00:40:49,000
- What a sweet girl.
- Indeed.

603
00:40:49,080 --> 00:40:52,680
You've made this old woman
truly delighted.

604
00:40:52,760 --> 00:40:53,760
Come.

605
00:40:56,440 --> 00:40:57,880
Come, everyone.

606
00:40:58,720 --> 00:41:01,600
Everyone, raise your cups.

607
00:41:01,680 --> 00:41:02,640
Let's celebrate this night together.

608
00:41:02,720 --> 00:41:03,800
Cheers.

609
00:41:03,880 --> 00:41:05,880
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

610
00:41:20,600 --> 00:41:23,640
Lady Rao's Nuo dance
was quite something, wasn't it?

611
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:26,600
Where's Han Liao?

612
00:41:27,240 --> 00:41:28,080
Han Liao?

613
00:41:29,200 --> 00:41:31,400
Right. When did that man sneak away?

614
00:41:32,280 --> 00:41:33,480
I didn't even notice.

615
00:41:36,760 --> 00:41:38,600
Thank you, Brother Jue,

616
00:41:38,680 --> 00:41:39,960
for bringing the Nuo dance
as a birthday gift

617
00:41:40,560 --> 00:41:42,680
and making me look so good.

618
00:41:42,760 --> 00:41:43,840
Unfortunately,

619
00:41:43,920 --> 00:41:45,320
- the Western Region incense you gave me
- It's fascinating.

620
00:41:45,400 --> 00:41:46,520
- is far too strong and gaudy.
- I'll show you again next time.

621
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:49,000
It's not really to my taste.

622
00:41:51,160 --> 00:41:52,800
It's you.

623
00:41:54,080 --> 00:41:55,200
Impossible. You clearly…

624
00:41:56,560 --> 00:41:58,040
How could it be you?

625
00:42:01,120 --> 00:42:02,240
Lady Rao organized the birthday banquet,

626
00:42:02,320 --> 00:42:03,800
and someone's jealousy
got the better of them.

627
00:42:03,880 --> 00:42:05,480
They locked her
in a room in the east wing.

628
00:42:05,560 --> 00:42:08,880
My Lord isn't at the banquet.
I'm afraid a fuss would cause gossip.

629
00:42:08,960 --> 00:42:10,800
I had no choice but to ask for your help.

630
00:42:11,640 --> 00:42:12,880
Get out!

631
00:42:24,800 --> 00:42:25,760
My Lady.

632
00:42:29,760 --> 00:42:30,800
General Qi…

633
00:42:38,360 --> 00:42:40,040
Then… Where's Jundai?

634
00:42:42,640 --> 00:42:44,800
I accidentally broke
the Han family's gift.

635
00:42:44,880 --> 00:42:47,080
He had his men carry it
back just as it was.

636
00:42:47,160 --> 00:42:51,440
Maybe he borrowed that large chest.

637
00:42:52,920 --> 00:42:54,960
- You wretched thing.
- Lady Wei Rao.

638
00:42:55,040 --> 00:42:57,880
Wait here. Don't follow me.

639
00:43:02,520 --> 00:43:04,800
My Lady, they are the Han family's men.

640
00:43:04,880 --> 00:43:05,880
Understood.

641
00:43:05,960 --> 00:43:07,920
JIANGYUN HALL

642
00:43:24,240 --> 00:43:25,800
- Come on! Hurry!
- I'm betting even again.

643
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:27,240
Odd. I'm betting odd.

644
00:43:27,320 --> 00:43:28,520
- I'm betting odd.
- Even!

645
00:43:28,600 --> 00:43:30,440
- Open it!
- Even!

646
00:43:30,520 --> 00:43:31,560
- Even!
- Odd!

647
00:43:50,480 --> 00:43:51,400
What a wonderful night.

648
00:44:05,800 --> 00:44:07,320
- What's wrong?
- This is bad.

649
00:44:09,240 --> 00:44:12,280
My dear, your granddaughter

650
00:44:12,360 --> 00:44:15,320
is truly the finest young lady
in the world.

651
00:44:15,400 --> 00:44:17,240
You raised her well.

652
00:44:17,320 --> 00:44:19,200
Come, let me toast you.

653
00:44:19,840 --> 00:44:21,440
After tonight,

654
00:44:21,520 --> 00:44:23,840
who in the capital won't know

655
00:44:23,920 --> 00:44:25,800
this wonderful young lady

656
00:44:25,880 --> 00:44:30,880
has just married into your Lu family?

657
00:44:32,840 --> 00:44:33,880
Come.

658
00:44:39,480 --> 00:44:41,920
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

659
00:44:42,000 --> 00:44:43,640
You don't need to see me any farther.

660
00:44:44,560 --> 00:44:47,720
My child, you did very well.

661
00:44:48,600 --> 00:44:51,040
No one could have done better.

662
00:44:51,640 --> 00:44:52,560
Go on back.

663
00:44:53,680 --> 00:44:54,880
Grandmother.

664
00:44:56,320 --> 00:44:59,160
I hear a distant cousin
has come from our hometown

665
00:44:59,800 --> 00:45:02,360
who looks so much like me.
It's hard to tell us apart.

666
00:45:02,960 --> 00:45:04,760
With her here to keep you company,

667
00:45:04,840 --> 00:45:06,640
I can leave with peace of mind.

668
00:45:07,160 --> 00:45:11,600
But she's unfamiliar with this place
and can be rather impulsive.

669
00:45:12,120 --> 00:45:14,680
Please look after her

670
00:45:15,200 --> 00:45:18,520
and keep her from stumbling into trouble.

671
00:45:22,800 --> 00:45:23,800
Don't worry.

672
00:45:25,040 --> 00:45:25,920
Go on back.

673
00:45:37,400 --> 00:45:38,240
First Aunt.

674
00:45:42,040 --> 00:45:42,880
Take care.

675
00:45:56,800 --> 00:46:00,400
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

676
00:46:06,240 --> 00:46:07,280
Let's go back.

677
00:46:14,280 --> 00:46:16,120
I'll go get the medicine
and be right back.

678
00:46:24,520 --> 00:46:25,560
Who are you, exactly?

679
00:48:52,320 --> 00:48:54,640
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
